00:01:49.069 --> 00:01:49.902
- Wow.

00:01:49.902 --> 00:01:51.260
- So, I think my parents were like, uh-oh,

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.093
we better go...

00:01:52.093 --> 00:01:52.926
