00:01:53.763 --> 00:01:55.501
- [Kelly] A boy Cabbage Patch doll.

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:56.518
- But I mean there's
nothing wrong with a boy

00:01:56.518 --> 00:01:57.718
Cabbage Patch, it's great, but...

00:01:57.718 --> 00:02:00.026
