00:04:42.808 --> 00:04:43.641
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:43.641 --> 00:04:44.474
- So, so big!

00:04:44.474 --> 00:04:45.307
- [Kelly] We were silly.

00:04:45.307 --> 00:04:46.140
