00:05:10.481 --> 00:05:13.063
just to be able to to be
there, and to do it together.

00:05:13.063 --> 00:05:13.954
- [Kelly] Absolutely. - Yeah.

00:05:13.954 --> 00:05:16.296
- I just love that
there's serious subjects,

00:05:16.296 --> 00:05:18.726
but there's so much kind
of dark humor, and...

00:05:18.726 --> 00:05:20.441
- [Linda] Yeah. - It's just...
- [Linda] Yeah.

00:05:20.441 --> 00:05:21.274
- It's so...

00:05:21.274 --> 00:05:22.107
