00:05:22.107 --> 00:05:22.940
- [Kelly] It's so good.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.606
- Thank you.
- Yeah, I love, I'm a fan..

00:05:24.606 --> 00:05:25.439
- Thank you.

00:05:25.439 --> 00:05:26.307
- And the series showed
the power of friendship

00:05:26.307 --> 00:05:27.140
