gotten me through things.

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:41.832
And my family, you know,
we're all very close.

00:05:41.832 --> 00:05:42.665
But... - [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:42.665 --> 00:05:46.136
- Like, I'm so, so lucky to
have so many amazing friends

00:05:46.136 --> 00:05:46.969
in my life.

00:05:46.969 --> 00:05:47.802
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:47.802 --> 00:05:48.654
- And it really has carried you through,

00:05:48.654 --> 00:05:51.803
'cause no matter how hard you
try, stuff happens, you know?

00:05:51.803 --> 00:05:52.927
- [Kelly] Yeah, you can't control...

00:05:52.927 --> 00:05:54.785
- And you feel sad, or
lonely, or you know,

00:05:54.785 --> 00:05:56.766
things are shocking in your
life, or traumatic, and...

00:05:56.766 --> 00:05:57.599
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:57.599 --> 00:05:58.998
- It's just nice to have a support system.

00:05:58.998 --> 00:06:00.305
- [Kelly] Well, speaking
