00:06:00.305 --> 00:06:01.887
we actually just had
Christina Applegate on...

00:06:01.887 --> 00:06:03.730
- I watched you guys, that
was such a great interview.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.563
- [Kelly] I love her.

00:06:04.563 --> 00:06:05.469
And I wanted to bring that up,

00:06:05.469 --> 00:06:06.822
like if you had that
support system in your life,

00:06:06.822 --> 00:06:08.714
